Structure point:
    Field x as integer.
    Field y as decimal.
End structure.
Declare pi as constexpr decimal with value 3.25.
Declare primes as constexpr array of integer with length 4 with values 2 followed by 3 followed by 5 followed by 7 done.
Declare origin as constexpr structure point with members x as 3 followed by y as 0.5 done.
Say pi.
Say Element at 2 in primes.
Say Member x of origin.
Say Member y of origin.
Procedure local returns decimal:
    Declare scale as constexpr decimal with value 1.5.
